abstract: >-
  Simulation code, device catalog, run records, pulse draws, plans, independent reviews and the paper (version 16) for a
  study of whether memistor-class electrochemical weights (Li-ion, metal-oxide and protonic ECRAM) can train neural
  networks with Tiki-Taka-family algorithms. Code is MIT-licensed; records, draws and text are CC BY 4.0.
keywords:
  - memistor
  - ECRAM
  - analog in-memory computing
  - Tiki-Taka
  - neural network training
  - simulation
